    "summary": "Errata to the Resurrection Orb ability of the Lokhust Lord, Overlord and Overlord with Translocation Shroud.\n\nOnce per battle for each unit, as any phase ends, you can make the bearer's unit **resurrect**: its [Reanimation Protocols](vsdata:ability/necrons.reanimation-protocols) activate, but it **heals** D6 wounds in place of D3.\n\nOnly 1 unit can resurrect per turn.",
